      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Highschool is almost over for the Best Friend Squad. Then, they'll move on. But they have the biggest dance of the year to look forward to before then, and they all have some things left unsaid that they'd rather spit out now than before it's too late.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A lighthearted, modern AU take on Princess Prom. But instead of waiting five seasons, all the ships happen on one night! FUN!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Keylime_Pi</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
